{"seq":58,"slug":"llm-serving-inference-systems","title":"大模型服务与推理系统","stage":"DONE","category":"ai-llm","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/h/ai-llm/llm-serving-inference-systems","rating":{"composite":3.88,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.75,"positioning":3.5,"strategic":4.67},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introMarkdown":"# 大模型服务与推理系统\n\n训练一个大模型只发生一次，服务它却要发生数十亿次。一个权重已经定型的模型，从「能跑出正确答案」到「能让上万并发用户在 200 毫秒内看到第一个字、并且每张 GPU 的账单还算得过来」，中间隔着一整套工程。这个 hub 讲的就是这套工程：如何把一个大语言模型高效、稳定、低成本地服务化。\n\n为什么推理值得单独成为一门学问？因为它的瓶颈和训练完全不同。训练是吞吐为王、批越大越好；而推理面对的是真实流量——请求长短不一、随机到达、用户在屏幕另一端等着逐字出现的回答。自回归解码每生成一个 token 就要把整个模型的权重从显存搬一遍，于是显存带宽而非算力成了天花板；KV 缓存随对话长度线性膨胀，吃掉的显存往往比模型本身还多。绕过这些约束，催生了过去三年最密集的系统创新。\n\n整个 hub 沿四条主线层层递进。第一条是**基础**：先把一次推理到底发生了什么讲清楚——prefill 与 decode 两个阶段、KV 缓存为什么存在、用哪些指标（TTFT、TPOT、goodput）衡量服务质量、自回归解码的根本瓶颈在哪。这是后面一切优化的坐标系。第二条是**吞吐优化**：连续批处理让 GPU 不再空等、PagedAttention 像操作系统管虚拟内存一样管 KV 缓存、投机解码用小模型抢跑换取大模型的并行验证——三件几乎重定义了开源推理基线的工作。第三条是**系统与框架**：把这些思想落进真实软件——vLLM、SGLang 等服务引擎，FP8/FP4 量化与 TensorRT-LLM，以及张量并行、专家并行到 prefill/decode 分离的分布式推理。第四条是**工程实践**：当推理要真正上线——Kubernetes 部署与按 SLA 自动扩缩、多租户公平调度、以及在成本与 SLA 之间找平衡点。\n\n四条主线不是平行的清单，而是一条因果链：基础定义了问题，优化提出了算法，系统把算法工程化，实践让它在生产环境里活下来。读完你应当能回答一个具体问题——给定一个模型、一份流量画像和一个延迟预算，该选什么引擎、开哪些优化、用几张什么卡、怎么扩缩，才能既不违反 SLA 又不烧钱。\n\n建议从基础读起。即便你已经在用 vLLM，理解「为什么 decode 是显存带宽受限」也会让你对每一个调参旋钮的作用恍然大悟，而不是盲目试错。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础","docCount":3,"url":"/h/ai-llm/llm-serving-inference-systems/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"inference-and-kv-cache","title":"推理流程与 KV 缓存","url":"/h/ai-llm/llm-serving-inference-systems/foundations/inference-and-kv-cache"},{"seq":2,"slug":"serving-metrics","title":"服务化指标","url":"/h/ai-llm/llm-serving-inference-systems/foundations/serving-metrics"},{"seq":3,"slug":"decoding-bottlenecks","title":"自回归解码瓶颈","url":"/h/ai-llm/llm-serving-inference-systems/foundations/decoding-bottlenecks"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"optimization","title":"吞吐优化","docCount":3,"url":"/h/ai-llm/llm-serving-inference-systems/optimization","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"continuous-batching","title":"连续批处理","url":"/h/ai-llm/llm-serving-inference-systems/optimization/continuous-batching"},{"seq":2,"slug":"paged-attention","title":"PagedAttention：分页式 KV 缓存","url":"/h/ai-llm/llm-serving-inference-systems/optimization/paged-attention"},{"seq":3,"slug":"speculative-decoding","title":"投机解码","url":"/h/ai-llm/llm-serving-inference-systems/optimization/speculative-decoding"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"systems","title":"系统与框架","docCount":3,"url":"/h/ai-llm/llm-serving-inference-systems/systems","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"vllm-and-frameworks","title":"vLLM 与服务框架","url":"/h/ai-llm/llm-serving-inference-systems/systems/vllm-and-frameworks"},{"seq":2,"slug":"quantization-tensorrt","title":"量化与 TensorRT-LLM","url":"/h/ai-llm/llm-serving-inference-systems/systems/quantization-tensorrt"},{"seq":3,"slug":"distributed-inference","title":"分布式推理","url":"/h/ai-llm/llm-serving-inference-systems/systems/distributed-inference"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"practice","title":"工程实践","docCount":3,"url":"/h/ai-llm/llm-serving-inference-systems/practice","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"deployment-autoscaling","title":"部署与自动扩缩","url":"/h/ai-llm/llm-serving-inference-systems/practice/deployment-autoscaling"},{"seq":2,"slug":"multi-tenancy-scheduling","title":"多租户与调度","url":"/h/ai-llm/llm-serving-inference-systems/practice/multi-tenancy-scheduling"},{"seq":3,"slug":"cost-sla-optimization","title":"成本与 SLA 优化","url":"/h/ai-llm/llm-serving-inference-systems/practice/cost-sla-optimization"}]}]}